  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4f3d8cd9a5b8305c",
      "translationZh": "重新设计 Claude Code 桌面应用，支持并行智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "26d0ede74c5626b7",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们发布了重新设计的 Claude Code 桌面应用，旨在帮助你同时运行更多 Claude Code 任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6be0c54e4796660e",
      "translationZh": "它包括用于管理多个会话的新侧边栏、用于安排工作区的拖放式布局、集成的终端和文件编辑器，以及性能提升和日常使用体验改进。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "32c73c12b28a9cf9",
      "translationZh": "全新的桌面体验",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b69f45817709913",
      "translationZh": "对许多开发者来说，智能体工作的方式已经改变。你不再是输入一条提示词，然后等待。而是在一个代码仓库中启动重构，在另一个仓库中修复 bug，再在第三个仓库中进行一轮测试编写；随着结果陆续返回，你逐一查看进展，在任务偏离方向时加以引导，并在交付前审查差异。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d4ab168f30773f0",
      "translationZh": "这款新应用是围绕如今智能体编程的实际体验构建的：多项工作同时进行，而你坐镇调度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "db24db4273524b47",
      "translationZh": "并行运行会话",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "db85305cc42f76b9",
      "translationZh": "新的侧边栏将所有活跃会话和近期会话集中在一处。你可以跨多个代码仓库启动工作，并随着结果陆续返回，在这些会话之间切换。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ed76f964dff7f5b5",
      "translationZh": "你可以按状态、项目或环境筛选，也可以让侧边栏按项目分组，以便更快地找到并恢复会话。当某个会话的 PR 被合并或关闭时，该会话会自动归档，让侧边栏始终聚焦于仍在进行的工作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2835d0926f991957",
      "translationZh": "当你需要在任务进行过程中提问时，可以打开侧边聊天（⌘ + ; 或 Ctrl + ;），从主对话中分出一段对话。侧边聊天会获取主对话线程的上下文，但不会将任何内容回写到主线程，以免让任务偏离方向。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "95f5178bf4d564e2",
      "translationZh": "无需离开应用，即可审查并交付",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ab2f320bf8c30086",
      "translationZh": "此次重新设计将更多常用工具整合到应用中，让你无需切换到编辑器，就能审查、微调并交付 Claude 的工作成果：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4ace94b763bb38aa",
      "translationZh": "集成终端：在会话进行的同时运行测试或构建。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8db51726dddaf53b",
      "translationZh": "应用内文件编辑器：打开文件，直接进行局部编辑，并保存更改。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "75c0b7675ecdbb63",
      "translationZh": "更快的差异查看器：经过重新构建，以提升处理大型变更集时的性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f62485120ddd7020",
      "translationZh": "扩展的预览功能：除了在预览窗格中运行本地应用服务器，还能在应用内打开 HTML 文件或 PDF。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "42813fc1ca334f7c",
      "translationZh": "每个窗格都支持拖放。你可以按照自己的工作方式，将终端、预览、差异查看器和聊天窗口排列成任意网格布局。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "732d31ed3bf495be",
      "translationZh": "桌面应用现在已具备与 CLI 相同的插件支持能力。无论你的组织是集中管理 Claude Code 插件，还是你自行在本地安装了插件，它们在桌面应用中的工作方式都与在终端中完全相同。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eceb2bd773e93171",
      "translationZh": "你仍然可以在本地或云端运行会话。SSH 支持现在从 Linux 扩展到了 Mac，因此你可以从这两个平台中的任意一个，将会话连接到远程机器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "82c792696dedf41e",
      "translationZh": "按你的工作方式自定义",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cd818b4996b1ff14",
      "translationZh": "三种视图模式——详细、普通和摘要——让你可以调整界面的信息详略程度，从完整展示 Claude 的工具调用到仅显示结果。新增的键盘快捷键涵盖会话切换、新建和导航；按 ⌘ + /（或 Ctrl + /）即可查看完整列表。新增的用量按钮让你一眼就能查看上下文窗口和会话用量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c7bce286723caecf",
      "translationZh": "在底层，应用经过了重构，以提升可靠性和速度，现在还会在 Claude 生成回复的同时以流式方式显示内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "16cd1e27075fb05a",
      "translationZh": "重新设计的桌面应用现已向所有订阅 Pro、Max、Team 和 Enterprise 套餐的 Claude Code 用户开放，也可通过 Claude API 使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7027c6d230a9381a",
      "translationZh": "下载应用；如果你已经安装，请更新并重启。查阅文档以了解更多信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cfdd51f52ea30533",
      "translationZh": "或阅读文档",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86ca514453af6811",
      "translationZh": "探索更多产品新闻，以及供使用 Claude 进行开发的团队参考的最佳实践。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "eca88f263f68bd33",
      "translationZh": "使用 mods 定制 Claude Code",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9ad98287a73ec34e",
      "translationZh": "Claude for Government 现已正式推出",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e5bd39b5e66aae0d",
      "translationZh": "为 Claude 构建插件",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f758dbc0dd3b7762",
      "translationZh": "AI 原生 SDLC 实践指南",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b8efdb74cc67b418",
      "translationZh": "借助 Claude 改变组织的运作方式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "804ae5cd41268915",
      "translationZh": "订阅开发者通讯",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1392200d117522a4",
      "translationZh": "产品更新、操作指南、社区精选等精彩内容，每月发送至你的收件箱。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1fc098e3bbb49641",
      "translationZh": "谢谢！你已成功订阅。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "611a3627b4ce510d",
      "translationZh": "抱歉，提交时出现了问题，请稍后重试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
